    "What is your relationship with mathematics?": "Mathematics feels like a puzzle I enjoy solving but not always understand deeply. As a full-time student studying economics and philosophy, I find it practical for modeling real-world scenarios but can be abstract when diving into pure math. I appreciate how it helps me think logically but sometimes wish it was more intuitive.",
